PROBE NIX JINX WARM WARM / NIX PEAK RSS NIX PEAK RSS JINX
lib 0.53 s 1.31 s 2.5x 238 MB 501 MB
hello 0.37 s 1.72 s 4.6x 88 MB 376 MB
firefox 3.19 s 11.44 s 3.6x 488 MB 1608 MB
