Nothing lost in translation
We can prove our translation is faithful. We evaluate every attribute of nixpkgs’ own CI configuration, ci/eval/outpaths.nix, with jinx and with nix-eval-jobs, and compare all the drvPaths.
On nixpkgs 6510408d, on x86_64-linux, aarch64-linux and aarch64-darwin:
ATTRIBUTES IDENTICAL DRVPATH FAIL ON BOTH SIDES DIFFER FAIL ON ONE SIDE ONLY
231,777 229,063 2,714 0 0
Zero differences or failing on one side.1
1The 2,714 that fail on both sides are the attributes Nix refuses to evaluate such as unsupported platform, broken, or insecure. 
